 material-work guard evidence, requested write scope, and workload diff evidence.
 This is a read-only admissibility check; it does not merge branch output or
 assign C-numbers.
+
+## Registry reconciliation
+
+Branch records are source evidence. The registry is an active index and must not
+drift silently.
+
+Read-only check:
+
+```bash
+python -m kernel.ion_agent_branch_capsule --ion-root . reconcile
+```
+
+Bounded registry repair/report write:
+
+```bash
+python -m kernel.ion_agent_branch_capsule --ion-root . reconcile --write --confirmation ION_BOUNDED_WRITE_CONFIRMED
+```
+
+Operator visibility snapshot:
+
+```bash
+python -m kernel.ion_agent_branch_capsule --ion-root . cockpit
+```
+
+Reconciliation may repair the branch registry and emit
+`BRANCH_CAPSULE_RECONCILIATION_REPORT_V0_1.json`, but it does not edit shared
+Capsule/Mini/HOT_CONTEXT/STATUS/ROUTE, assign C-numbers, or settle branch output.
+

